---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro'
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about PrismaLens and our mission to make incident response faster and smarter.">
  <Hero
    title="About PrismaLens"
    subtitle="We're building the future of incident investigation — where AI does the searching and your team does the fixing."
  />
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-300">
      <p>
        PrismaLens was born from a simple frustration: when production breaks, engineers spend more
        time searching for the cause than fixing it. They jump between Grafana dashboards, grep
        through logs, check deployment timelines, and piece together a story manually.
      </p>
      <p>
        We believe AI agents can do this investigation work — faster, more thoroughly, and without
        the cognitive load. PrismaLens connects to your existing observability stack and uses
        LangGraph-powered agents to automatically correlate signals, build timelines, and surface
        root causes.
      </p>
      <p>
        PrismaLens is open source at its core. We believe incident response tooling should be
        transparent, extensible, and free from vendor lock-in. Self-host with Docker Compose and
        maintain full control over your data.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CTA
    title="Join the community"
    description="PrismaLens is open source. Star us on GitHub, contribute, or just say hello."
    href="https://github.com/prismalens"
    label="View on GitHub"
  />
</BaseLayout>
